go 1.26.1

// `go.work` redirects `require graphics.gd` in any in-tree module to the
// local working copy. Without it, `go build ./examples/canarybird` would
// try to resolve graphics.gd via the proxy and fail (v0.0.0 isn't
// published).
//
// CI does not rely on this file — the workflow stages each example in a
// tempdir and runs `go mod edit -replace=graphics.gd=$GITHUB_WORKSPACE`
// before building. The workspace file is purely for the dev/editor loop.
use .
use ./examples/canarybird
